candidate = num\\\\n        count += (1 if num == candidate else -1)\\\\n    # 第二阶段验证（此处省略）\\\\n    return candidate\\\\n```\\\\n关于其时间复杂度和空间复杂度的正确描述是？\\\",\\n    \\\"userAnswer\\\": \\\"A. 时间复杂度O(n^2)，空间复杂度O(1)\\\",\\n    \\\"correctAnswer\\\": \\\"C. 时间复杂度O(n)，空间复杂度O(1)\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"判断\\\",\\n    \\\"question\\\": \\\"在MapReduce编程模型中，Shuffle阶段负责将Mapper输出的键值对根据Key进行排序和分区，然后传输到对应的Reducer。这个过程是MapReduce框架自动处理的，程序员无法干预其具体实现。\\\",\\n    \\\"userAns',NULL,1,'\r\n### Error updating database.  Cause: com.mysql.cj.jdbc.exceptions.MysqlDataTruncation: Data truncation: Invalid JSON text: \"Invalid value.\" at position 1 in value for column \'user_knowledge_assessment.ai_response\'.\r\n### The error may exist in file [D:\\Code\\Knowledge\\ruoyi-project\\target\\classes\\mapper\\project\\UserKnowledgeAssessmentMapper.xml]\r\n### The error may involve com.ruoyi.project.mapper.UserKnowledgeAssessmentMapper.insertUserKnowledgeAssessment-Inline\r\n### The error occurred while setting parameters\r\n### SQL: insert into user_knowledge_assessment          ( user_id,             history_id,             assess_title,             questions,             answers,             weak_points,                          overall_analysis,             ai_response,             total_score,             status,                          create_time )           values ( ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,                          ?,             ?,             ?,             ?,                          ? )\r\n### Cause: com.mysql.cj.jdbc.exceptions.MysqlDataTruncation: Data truncation: Invalid JSON text: \"Invalid value.\" at position 1 in value for column \'user_knowledge_assessment.ai_response\'.\n; Data truncation: Invalid JSON text: \"Invalid value.\" at position 1 in value for column \'user_knowledge_assessment.ai_response\'.; nested exception is com.mysql.cj.jdbc.exceptions.MysqlDataTruncation: Data truncation: Invalid JSON text: 